cc -O src/a.c to out/a.o stem a
cc -O -DB src/b.c to out/b.o stem b
static out/s1.x from src/a.c stem s1
static out/s2.x from src/a.c stem s2
yacc src/g.y to out/g.tab.c grouped
pv pattern-var
child sees inherited
late
sec deps late
all: out/a.o out/b.o out/s1.x out/s2.x out/g.tab.c x.pv inh sec order-only: out
